WEBVTT

00:01:01.297 --> 00:01:03.957
So, let me start 
for those who are not aware

00:01:03.957 --> 00:01:05.737
of the work of the Qatar Foundation.

00:01:05.737 --> 00:01:09.217
Tell us a bit about the purpose 
of the Foundation

00:01:09.217 --> 00:01:14.823
and also briefly about the role 
of Hamad Bin Khalifa University within it.

00:01:16.006 --> 00:01:17.576
Thank you very much.

00:01:17.576 --> 00:01:21.371
The Foundation started around 25 years ago

00:01:21.371 --> 00:01:24.561
with the mission of really investing 
in the human capital,

00:01:25.141 --> 00:01:29.181
believing that any development, 
whether it's economic or social,

00:01:29.181 --> 00:01:32.069
is going to be based 
on education and research.